# Read by `electron-vite build`, so desktop builds only: the web build reads env files from
# src/renderer, and the catalogue sends web users a `#code=` link that needs no catalogue.
#
# Where a `cob://build/<id>` link fetches the build from (platform/links.ts). The renderer CSP
# in src/renderer/index.html has to allow this host too. Override for one build from the shell,
# e.g. VITE_CATALOGUE_API=http://127.0.0.1:8787 against a local `npm run dev:api`.
VITE_CATALOGUE_API=https://cob-codex-api.ryongenn.workers.dev
